      "content": "The minimum wage is worth less than it was in 1968 💵\n\n$7.25/hr today buys less than minimum wage did 56 years ago.\n\nIf it had tracked productivity growth: $24+/hour.\n\nThe wage didn't fall. Prices rose. Wages didn't follow.\n\n#moneyfacts #minimumwage #inflation #economics #financialreality",
