      "content": "The 20% down payment rule is a myth — and the industry invented it 🏠\n\nThe rule was created by private mortgage insurers in the 1950s to protect lenders, not you.\n\nToday you can buy with 3% down.\n\nThe real cost of waiting to save 20%: years of rent + home price appreciation.\n\n#moneyfacts #homebuying #realestate #mortgagetips #personalfinance",
