      "content": "97% of all money has never been printed 💻\n\nTotal US physical cash in circulation: ~$2.3 trillion.\n\nTotal money supply (M2): ~$21 trillion.\n\nThe gap? Digital entries in bank computers — money that has never existed as paper.\n\n#moneyfacts #banking #economics #personalfinance #financialfacts",
